            "dataFlowTrace": "`set_receipt_template` -> `db.execute` -> `template`\n\n- **[ENTRY]** `set_receipt_template`  `app/db.py:71`\n  The caller-provided template value enters this function as the template argument with no local validation.\n- **[FLAG]** `db.execute`  `app/db.py:74`\n  The SQL UPDATE statement is prepared to persist the supplied template into the receipt_template column.\n- **[SINK]** `template`  `app/db.py:75`\n  The unmodified template value is bound into the UPDATE parameters and stored for later use by receipt rendering code.",
