            "impact": "If the fallback secret is in use, an unauthenticated remote client could forge a session cookie that causes `login_required` to treat the request as logged in. The resulting impact depends on the wrapped route: it may expose merchant-only pages or permit actions available to the chosen account, subject to any additional object-level or role checks in those routes.",
