                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Bind menu-item reads to the current tenant context. In practice, pass the authenticated `restaurant_id` into `get_menu_item` and query with both `id` and `restaurant_id`; if no row matches both values, return no record and let the route handle it as not found or unauthorized.",
