            "function": "app/db.py:get_menu_item",
            "impact": "If those prerequisites hold, a merchant account could retrieve another restaurant’s menu item by supplying that item’s `id`. If downstream logic reuses the same unscoped identifier for modification, the same boundary gap can affect integrity as well as disclosure.",
