            "dataFlowTrace": "`@bp.route(\"/restaurants\")` -> `restaurants` -> `db.list_restaurants` -> `render_template`\n\n- **[ENTRY]** `@bp.route(\"/restaurants\")`  `app/routes/admin.py:8`\n  An unauthenticated HTTP GET request can be dispatched to this admin endpoint because no access-control decorator is applied here.\n- **[FLAG]** `restaurants`  `app/routes/admin.py:9`\n  The handler accepts the request and performs no authentication or authorization check before continuing.\n- **[FLOW]** `db.list_restaurants`  `app/routes/admin.py:10`\n  The endpoint loads the complete restaurant listing for the current request context without first establishing caller privileges.\n- **[SINK]** `render_template`  `app/routes/admin.py:11`\n  The retrieved restaurant records are rendered into the admin response returned to the requester.",
