                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Add a server-side authentication and authorization check before `db.list_restaurants()` and `render_template()` run, such as an admin-only decorator or a blueprint-level guard for `/admin` routes. If the listing is intentionally public, consider moving it out of the admin namespace or documenting that exposure explicitly so the route purpose matches its access model.",
