                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Add an explicit non-root runtime user in the `Dockerfile` before `CMD`, and ensure `/app` ownership or permissions allow the application and `migrations/init_db.py` to run under that account. If the deployment platform already enforces a non-root user externally, align the image with that requirement so the runtime identity is defined in-repo rather than assumed.",
