                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Remove the hard-coded fallback for `SECRET_KEY` or fail startup when the value is missing or equal to the built-in default. If a development convenience is required, gate it explicitly to a non-production mode so the application does not boot with `\"portal-dev-key\"` in normal deployments.",
                  "text": "Remove the hard-coded fallback for `SECRET_KEY` or fail startup when the value is missing or equal to the built-in default."
