                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Remove the built-in fallback session secret and require a deployment-provided `SECRET_KEY` before the application starts, or fail closed when the secret is unset or equal to the known default. Because `login_required()` is using session-backed identity as designed, the relevant mitigation is to ensure the session signing key is unique per deployment and not a shipped constant.",
