                  "markdown": "Review the bootstrap path that seeds fixed accounts and passwords. If these accounts are intended only for local or demo use, isolate that behavior behind an explicit non-production option; otherwise replace shipped passwords with operator-supplied initial secrets or require a password change before the first successful login. The `login()` handler itself is performing ordinary database-backed authentication; the security concern is the presence of known out-of-box credentials in the initialized data.",
