                "verification": "Before the change, submit POST /login with owner@b021bistro.io / bistro123 or owner@noodlebot.io / noodle123 and observe that the handler establishes a session and redirects to menus.dashboard. After the change, the same requests should stay on the login page and return the generic invalid-credentials message, while a non-default account with a valid password should still authenticate successfully."
