            "debateSummary": "- Review outcome in the provided validation data: **true positive**\n- Agreement count from the supplied transcript: **1 model argued true positive, 0 argued false positive**\n- The supporting argument was that `os.environ.get(\"DEBUG\", \"true\")` makes debug mode the shipped default, and `app.run(..., debug=debug)` applies it with no environment guard.\n- The counterpoint raised within the same review was contextual: `HOST` defaults to `127.0.0.1`, and `DEBUG` is operator-controlled configuration rather than remote request input.\n- The finding was effectively unchallenged in the provided debate material; the transcript contains a single model review, so there was no multi-model disagreement to compare.",
            "end_line": 10,
            "fileSourceUrl": "https://github.com/caldova-io/merchant-portal/blob/47bbff4de1fa369ff4fcac75139b2203096b29d1/run.py#L10",
            "firstDetected": "2026-08-27T12:55:53.125Z",
